@GateHooks
Feature: Failing scenario feature

    Before Feature:
        * Record the gate step before the feature

    Scenario: Failing gate scenario
        * Record the start of gate scenario 1
        * Fail the gate scenario

    Scenario: Passing gate scenario
        * Record the start of gate scenario 2
        * Record the end of gate scenario 2

    After Feature:
        * Record the gate step after the feature
